 <Text>Verifying that interpolateAtSample ignores the centroid-qualifier.
    Draw a fan of narrow triangles (large number of pixels on the edges).
    Set varyings &apos;barycentricsA&apos; and &apos;barycentricsB&apos; to contain barycentric coordinates.
    Add centroid-qualifier for barycentricsB.
 =&gt; interpolateAtSample(barycentricsB, N) ~= interpolateAtSample(barycentricsA, N)
</Text>
